  r1,"console-report-does-not-require-rendering-dependencies",环境未安装 `rich` 等可选依赖,用户启用 observability 并选择 `report_format=console`,console 输出 MUST 正常产生
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"stable-prefix-and-stable-k-v-ordering","","系统输出一行 console 报告并包含字段 `{b: 2, a: 1, skip: None}`","该行 MUST 以 `[scalim] <subsystem>:` 开头"
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"report-remains-readable-without-monospace-rendering","",读者在比例字体/日志系统 UI 中查看 console 输出,输出中的关键语义 MUST 仍可通过 kind token 与 `k=v` 直接读出
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"per-source-is-emitted-as-multiple-lines",关联命中统计包含多个 `source_id`,系统输出 console 报告,系统 MUST 为每个 `source_id` 输出一行 kind=`per_source` 的记录
  r5,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r5,"samples-output-is-bounded-and-line-oriented",系统收集到 100 条 type mismatch 样本,系统输出 console 报告,系统 MUST 明确输出 `showing=<N>`（N 为有界数，例如 5）